title: The Strike and the Sejm
subtitle: A protest with repression or a real offer: PPS answers in the Sejm.
new-page: true
tags: pl_event
face-image: img/polish/polish_event_strike_response.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_union_rules && PolishUnions.responseDue(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Event parliament.strike_response, B11+B12 (technical reference 17.5.1; card catalogue 7.10): the one answer in this
// phase of the dispute, also in opposition; 0 T and 0 R for the position. It reads the earlier choices: the partner,
// the strike and the protection are not chosen again.
PolishUnions.responseView(Q);
!}

= The strike and the Sejm

[+ pl_resp_text +]

- @demands
- @settlement
- @order

@demands
title: Demand the end of repression and concessions for the workers
subtitle: [? if pl_resp_offer : The offer lapses; the next round asks for the fuller package. ?][? if not pl_resp_offer : The demands are put to the government now. ?] The thresholds and the executor's consent still apply.
choose-if: {! return PolishUnions.responseStatus(Q, 'demands').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_resp_demands_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.responseChoose(Q, 'demands');
!}
go-to: result

@settlement
title: Seek a settlement and end the strike on agreed terms
subtitle: [? if pl_resp_offer : PPS accepts the offer and calls for the agreed end. ?][? if not pl_resp_offer : PPS puts one limited package; if it is accepted, the agreed end follows. ?] No second acceptance.
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.responseChoose(Q, 'settlement');
!}
go-to: result

@order
title: Back the restoration of order and call for the end of the strike
subtitle: PPS withdraws its support without new concessions: the union's dissent rises (+10) and its trust falls (−8), once. The call does not end the protest and is no order to the police.
on-arrival: {!
PolishUnions.responseChoose(Q, 'order');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= The strike and the Sejm

[+ pl_union_result +]

- @root: Continue.
